{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "8b623db2d20a5cc45ae136a994211a24b9a2a88b6304c9d39bc732890bd67290", "ja": "それぞれの役割", "zh": "各自的角色", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bfed564fb0ea70eb22ddfcbb196b7e0464f9d2aabd0ec1df76ab88d210cbc205", "ja": "『竜宮小町』としての初仕事である記者会見\nに臨む伊織、あずさ、亜美の3人と、忙しく\n立ち回るプロデューサーの律子。それぞれの\n役割を立派にこなす中、あずさは律子もまた\n表舞台に立つことを望む様子を見せる。", "zh": "伊织、梓和亚美这3人参加了作为『竜宮小町』首次工作的记者会，制作人律子则忙碌地四处奔走。在各自出色完成职责的过程中，梓似乎也希望律子能够站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d83fbe53f59a38f86d5dc4b02950268a54192a400f1b7c8b15bb3b0dccb2e6de", "ja": "（律子プロデュースの新ユニット『竜宮小町』が\nついに始動。まずは発表記者会見だ！）", "zh": "（由律子负责制作的新组合『龙宫小町』终于启动了。首先是发布记者会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "77b284738c7b64e4518856ebe2f6ec91058ae618196bca90b723c67e613d85d5", "ja": "それじゃ、インタビュー始めてください。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "那么，请开始采访吧。\n请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "d3224c44ed4c77740d76fe2d5d764f6bd9299c14e09e8397d10633efdbc44fbb", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす♪", "zh": "请多关照～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "08715a99d744cc9161f4b11983ccbe210483713674f30d16d9d1bbc4fa875b4d", "ja": "よろしくお願いします～♪", "zh": "请多关照～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "d3224c44ed4c77740d76fe2d5d764f6bd9299c14e09e8397d10633efdbc44fbb", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす♪", "zh": "请多关照～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1005_journalist", "source_sha256": "c78ac557db32d2dc65a28de5837fe233b14c389d7227f6887c69da3dca372a91", "ja": "では、まず新ユニット『竜宮小町』のことを\nいろいろ教えてもらえますか？", "zh": "那么，首先能请您多告诉我一些关于新组合『竜宮小町』的事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "a711e7c4c84a4a3ff5e9b559a14edae04d11532bd3b92746ad0f87f3f9798bef", "ja": "はーい、リーダーの水瀬伊織ちゃんです♪\n今日は私たち竜宮小町の紹介、頑張りますね♪", "zh": "好——，我是队长水濑伊织♪  \n今天我会努力介绍一下我们龙宫小町♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "8d4923aab20af9cf263944edd5245d0e467f092d8f9e3d07cfe33141c4680bc4", "ja": "竜宮小町は私たちの仲間のアイドル、秋月律子さんが\nプロデュースしたユニットなんですよ～。", "zh": "龙宫小町是由我们偶像伙伴秋月律子制作的组合哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "4bced8425ac52b1692907687a7f8910dfb2a0c98994007024cdad18cb79130ee", "ja": "つまり、新人プロデューサーの律っちゃんのために、\n亜美たちがひと肌ぬぎぬぎしたってすんぽーだよ♪", "zh": "也就是说，为了新人制作人律子姐，亚美她们可是亲自出力帮忙了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "540b12d841458dd3734647ec8f10610eb06b5cbf5d773b931c88df1dfd1e9b55", "ja": "ちょっと、どうして上から言うのよ。あと言い方！\n新ユニットらしく、もっと初々しく言いなさいっ。", "zh": "喂，你干嘛用这种居高临下的口气说话啊。还有，你这说法是怎么回事！\n要像新组合一样，说得更青涩一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1010_011ami", "source_sha256": "e93959af30f6051652a25db7993cd039ca2f5c5938cb8c12b0bf0f618b0387d5", "ja": "いおりん、その言い方がもう初々しくないよ？", "zh": "伊织，你这种说法已经不够青涩了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "4bfe221ab248a814217ed6127903e0145cae460084a201534f86271df827b2b7", "ja": "……と、こんな感じで、\n仲良くやっています～♪", "zh": "……总之，就是这样，\n我们相处得很融洽～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1012_journalist", "source_sha256": "69488a67517b45c71cbe3beb56fe34bc033d04b708b55afd8ac6691d568f31e6", "ja": "あはは、なんだか765プロさんらしいですね！\nでは、続いて今後のユニット活動について軽く……", "zh": "啊哈哈，总觉得很有765事务所的风格呢！\n那么，接下来就简单聊聊今后的组合活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "732b4a80fb61090d5f01473bdf3bab3b4d0c83587c2ef0b2f079679bc8f89b3e", "ja": "初々しくないにもほどがある～！\nはぁ。先が思いやられます……。", "zh": "也太不像新人了吧～！\n唉，真让人担心今后的发展……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "61e951a23e8faa004aff57f98880efbf1b37806e9396a5613b4bc259fefc154d", "ja": "はは、あの3人らしくていいんじゃないか？\nこんなに安心して見ていられる記者発表も珍しいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，这样才像那3个人嘛，不是挺好的吗？\n能让人这么放心观看的记者会，还真是少见啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "3eab0d9992f1f0fe2d51a606d6d0e377778f51e49c3da45b668b3ac72af6bc09", "ja": "それ、いつもと違って、\n他人事スタイルで見てるからじゃないでしょうね？", "zh": "该不会是因为你这次和往常不同，是抱着事不关己的态度在看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "35181bf4e59083bcbc0302cd47689cbf13e9c313836d622a99734c057b5eafce", "ja": "とんでもない。積み重なった信頼の証というか……。", "zh": "才不是。该说是日积月累的信赖证明吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1017_se", "source_sha256": "8d672fc290e4f5bb608e77c9c513ae831b878bcdb2a9947dcc94a54988e63289", "ja": "ブーッ！　ブーッ！", "zh": "哔──！哔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "8d5b27cf06be675f26a4a4c6c4c101d179a5005c3ea436fbd7db5358aef09e8c", "ja": "っと、すみません、電話みたい……もしもし？\nお世話になっております、765プロの秋月です。", "zh": "啊，对不起，电话好像响了……喂？\n承蒙关照，我是765事务所的秋月。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "080acbaf6dbd4a3216e32b9e1dc3927facb5d157ef2ce54f23e4eca1899af7ab", "ja": "はい、はい……そうですね、よろしくお願いします。\nあの、後でこちらから折り返させていただいても……。", "zh": "好的，好的……是的，那就拜托您了。\n那个，之后由我这边再回电话给您……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "095de19be92710f3261ff553bc41b1039e76ea85410112168f7f4aca51420ade", "ja": "そうですね、よろしくお願いします。\nそれではまた。失礼いたします！", "zh": "是啊，拜托您了。\n那么回头再联系。失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "d363950da695a41ea4c93960b1fec8c99a3c3e8dde35cd5b4881d3a7c1f49dc3", "ja": "……ふう。ずっと電話が鳴りっぱなしですよ、もう。\nプロデューサーって、思ってた以上に大変なんですね。", "zh": "……呼。电话一直响个不停，真是的。\n制作人比我想象中还要辛苦呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ac7580f482637028f38f40bdbb8eb009e36f3b20b65ce31af831d4f2a1813aa9", "ja": "うん、まあ慣れだよ、慣れ。", "zh": "嗯，习惯了就好，习惯了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "083713ca30fe72d1fe0dd86f5c2ec396dbcd527708894d00f7b3f6ba0e4973ca", "ja": "……なーんか得意顔。\nさては先輩風ってやつですか？", "zh": "……总觉得一脸得意呢。\n莫非这就是所谓的摆前辈架子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9fe2e7d0a294d72d15dad0110d128d1ee56f0c2a1c0e429aa2df4b03a49570de", "ja": "い、いや、そんなつもりはないけど……\n偉そうだったかな？", "zh": "没、没有，我没那个意思啊……\n显得很了不起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1025_009rit", "source_sha256": "0748a02115aad32c52777c28a0d0b99abf8f23bd4421cd08f58681676dd29a8a", "ja": "ふふっ、ごめんなさい、冗談です。\n次のラジオ出演も、付き添いお願いしますね。", "zh": "呵呵，抱歉，我开玩笑的。\n下次参加广播节目，也请你陪我一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c90b8f2bea72f21f8305f4b1b481eadbb749227d462c411fe44727c00dc745d2", "ja": "うん？　次のラジオって？", "zh": "嗯？下次的电台节目？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "0b6e5b7c72f2033352017f772c592435a722a856e367069afc06962b90416644", "ja": "あれ？　だから、竜宮小町でウェブラジオに……。\nあっ、もしかして私、共有してませんでした！？", "zh": "咦？所以说，要以龙宫小町的名义做网络广播……  \n啊，难道我还没跟大家说过吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "10bf09da77be053db8c7734187f162cf93454bcfb2cbf4ca4a3ae47440114594", "ja": "そうだな、スケジュールに書いてないから多分……。\nまいったな。あずささん、この後グラビアがあるんだ。", "zh": "是啊，日程上没写，所以大概……真伤脑筋。三浦梓小姐之后还有写真拍摄呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1029_009rit", "source_sha256": "2870211e474f8212a03728b5082d3ac4bc888344d4a35e80db66c3b39e93e67e", "ja": "ええっ！？　やだ、ごめんなさい！", "zh": "诶！？不要，对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ec66c545144c48a6ce3d7d8cf574f48dd20d7262bf17ab9d04d0750c95aceb67", "ja": "いや、共有漏れはこっちの責任でもあるから。\nそれより、どうするかだけど……よし。", "zh": "不，信息没同步到位也是我这边的责任。\n比起这个，关键是现在该怎么办……好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5049336334fcd6e4f7d02011d58c802842aee166cef6e9ccee41cc83f522d198", "ja": "ウェブラジオは伊織と亜美と……律子で出てもらって、\nあずささんはこっちが終わり次第合流、でどうかな。", "zh": "网络广播就让伊织、亚美，还有……律子一起参加吧。至于梓，等这边结束后再汇合，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "58855b7d25d3ca2bb5fb1d8e60b699ddd3b36df73464effd3aff2c1e30f4a0dc", "ja": "え？　私は……。でも2人だとユニット感が弱いか。\nなら代わりに私が出て、回した方が……。", "zh": "诶？那我……不过，要是2个人的话，组合感会不会有点弱？\n那不如由我代替她参加，主持起来会更……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1033_009rit", "source_sha256": "b3d1adfa9f5daaca703d2447e7a589adf2a1a10e23ba8017e4a4214c7c636637", "ja": "うん、そうですね、それが最適だと思います。\nすみません、助かります！", "zh": "嗯，说得对，我认为那样是最合适的。\n不好意思，帮大忙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "3758112b9b200dae6d2030b6a5c906e25f2e17ef433e1ab554812c90651f5a88", "ja": "困ったときはお互い様だよ。\nとりあえず、車を回してくる。", "zh": "遇到困难本来就该互相帮忙嘛。\n我先把车开过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1035_009rit", "source_sha256": "5478d31e90304052368e54d093e663c1c0e35fe208c957160bad5e85bec9a5fc", "ja": "お願いします。\n……ふふっ、さすが先輩。頼りになりますね！", "zh": "拜托了。\n……呵呵，不愧是前辈，真是可靠呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "e09880ecc190256db4b1166c0041cf6be8632d15edda98dea3b19601dee4fbbb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\n撮影、なんとかオンスケでいけました～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～\n拍摄总算按计划完成了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "a50080d75c7c56e7bd874465811f7aa2618a157d8b7e5cb865a08d3fe3297d09", "ja": "あずささん、お疲れ様です。\nさすがですね、バッチリでしたよ！", "zh": "梓小姐，辛苦了。\n真不愧是您，完成得非常好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "39303b929c15c7e768da8b8f5fbe065fbbb0a3140b29b3ef2d4f3576b35ed24c", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nこれで間に合いそうですか？", "zh": "谢谢您♪\n这样能赶得上吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a2b0cdd8b29ea913ea959d4718c84fb473ca081b64ff6f84c48907cb3e86daa0", "ja": "ええ、向こうは始まったところですから。\nせわしなくてすみません。", "zh": "嗯，对方才刚开始。不好意思这么忙乱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1041_010azu", "source_sha256": "4f7d66824258d32d046524f20651751ba7f7cf2e852030f84adf8de7ce2bfd51", "ja": "いいえ、こちらこそ。今ごろラジオには、\n律子さんが出てくれているんですよね？", "zh": "不，是我才该这么说。现在这个时候，\n律子已经在广播里出场了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "60a96f8580a8fcc309a0c91a44b556e389d15b7894015cdaa926e70146e7754e", "ja": "はい。今回、本人は裏方に徹するつもりだった\nみたいですけど、一切出ないのも不自然だし。", "zh": "是的。不过这次，她本人好像是打算全程负责幕后，但完全不出场也不太自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "cc5d6349412bae2031368af0bd99c22524818739d675081514ea38e87aa62de7", "ja": "もちろん、プロデューサーとしてですけど……\nでも、いい機会だったと思います。", "zh": "当然，是以制作人的身份出面就是了……\n不过，我觉得这是个不错的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1044_010azu", "source_sha256": "5da5a1054d08f497f766afdc222a808a79e91d16fbf7aa197d9a1d529ff32ef4", "ja": "そうですよね。\n私も、気軽に顔を出してもらえた方がうれしいです。", "zh": "是啊。\n如果您能轻松地来露个面，我也会更开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0351_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0351_story_04_1045_010azu", "source_sha256": "245cbdf497559f8e140f7f970fd8b43d75f27016c09bdf7134e50e74348ad918", "ja": "ううん、私も、じゃなくて……。\n私たちも。", "zh": "不对，不是“我”，而是……\n“我们”才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
